  "project_description": "Layout Components (LC) is an extension of Drupal core Layout Builder that adds a richer, more visual section/column/component builder. It replaces core's choose-block, choose-section, add-block, update-block, configure-section and remove controllers/forms with its own AJAX-driven UI (a lateral dialog, live preview, tooltips), and ships a family of Bootstrap-grid layout plugins (one to six columns) plus deep per-section/per-column/per-title styling (background image/color, borders, radius, paddings, sizing, height, extra classes and attributes, role-based visibility). Editors get copy/paste of sections, columns and blocks through a private-tempstore clipboard, sub-sections nested inside columns, and default/overwrite section configuration driven from five site-wide settings forms. A form-element API (the Api\\* classes plus a custom render element and color field) lets developers build their own LC components; ~23 lc_* submodules provide ready-made components (accordion, card, carousel, countdown, tabs, timeline, video, iframe, image variants, social links, slick, etc.) documented separately.",
